          "message": {
            "text": "DM-2569: native pseudo-marker connected components are ownership discriminators, not complete native paint bounds. Chromium ScrollbarTheme paints both end buttons and the track inside the full scrollbar display-item rectangle. Classic native crops now use exact border/client/gutter geometry (including corner overlap) so platform buttons that ignore marker CSS remain in the authenticated source raster.",
            "markdown": "DM-2569: native pseudo-marker connected components are ownership discriminators, not complete native paint bounds. Chromium ScrollbarTheme paints both end buttons and the track inside the full scrollbar display-item rectangle. Classic native crops now use exact border/client/gutter geometry (including corner overlap) so platform buttons that ignore marker CSS remain in the authenticated source raster."
          },
          "locations": [
